OL,3,GNEWSAHow a grassroots football pioneer
OL,4,Achanged Birmingham
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom grassroots football to community
OL,7,Fprojects, Lincoln Moses spent decades
OL,8,Fcreating opportunities for young people
OL,9,Facross Birmingham. Following his death,
OL,10,Fhundreds of tributes have highlighted a
OL,11,Flegacy that stretched far beyond the
OL,12,Fpitch.
OL,14,F"Legend" appears again and again.
OL,16,FSo does "mentor" and "community hero".
OL,18,FAmong the hundreds of tributes paid
OL,19,Fonline following the death of Lincoln
OL,20,FMoses MBE was one from his daughter,
OL,21,FNatasha, who described him as "a true
OL,22,Flegend" and "the best dad".
